Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.47,0:00:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You get...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.48,0:00:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  天啊  艾玛  你在笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,my God,Emma. You're laughing.
