Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《老友记》  第九季 第7集   罗斯的饶舌歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends S09E07 The One With Ross's Inappropriate Song
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.72,0:02:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们懂得投资吗  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} What do you know about investments?  How come?
