Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个同事的提议让我觉得很兴奋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A guy at work got me excited..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是关于投资鸸鸟农场  很酷吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}about going in on an emu farm. That'd be kind of cool,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.15,0:02:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在周末的时候过去帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pitching in on the weekends,
