Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它事实上是在提倡健康的身体观念\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it actually promotes a healthy body image..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为即使是大屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}because even big butts..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是"可口多汁的双乳"都是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or "juicy doubles" are..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.93,0:06:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请不要把她从我身边带走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please don't take her away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.23,0:06:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  请进 我是凯瑟琳  仲介商\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi,come on in. I'm Catherine,the listing agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.93,0:06:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  我是乔伊  他是钱德勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi,I'm Joey. This is Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.41,0:06:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么理查要卖掉这地方呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how come Richard's selling the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.31,0:06:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,破产了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Went bankrupt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.59,0:06:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,医疗误诊  被自己的胡子噎死吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Medical malpractice? Choked on his own mustache?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上他要买一间更大的公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually he's buying a much bigger place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,景观很棒  可以看到中央公园\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's got a great view of Central Park..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's enough out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方有什么我们需要知道的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is there anything we should know about the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:07:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电器用品全部都包含\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All the appliances are included.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光线充足  还有新的厨房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a lot of light,a new kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们俩住在这里一定会很幸福\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think you guys would be very happy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们没有在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,we're not together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是一对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not a couple
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们绝对不是一对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're definitely not a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  抱歉  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Okay. Sorry.  That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.18,0:07:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  你看起来好像是被侮辱了一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow,you seemed pretty insulted by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是怎样  我配不上你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What,I'm not good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不要再讨论这个问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We are not gonna have this conversation again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么备受这家伙的威胁呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why am I so intimidated by this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,矫情的艺术品  又大又阳刚的沙发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pretentious art. This huge,macho couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道他整天只会坐在那边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When we know all he does is sit around all day..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哭泣着为什么莫妮卡会离开他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}crying about losing Monica
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.01,0:07:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,投入一个真男人的怀抱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.87,0:07:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他应该不在这里吧  对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't think he's here,do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个好地方  但是我必须要说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, It's a nice place,but I gotta say,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我能不能住得习惯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know if I see myself living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们来试试看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我可以住得习惯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah,I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这些录影带  他以为他是谁啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at these videos. I mean,who does he think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.83,0:08:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《紧急搜捕令》 《肮脏哈里》 《铁窗喋血》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Magnum Force,Dirty Harry,Cool Hand Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  我的天  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Oh,my God.  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一卷带子上面有莫妮卡的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a tape here with Monica's name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.90,0:08:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一卷带子上面有女生的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A tape with a girl's name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是性爱录影带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's probably a sex tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上面写着"莫妮卡"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This says "Monica."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而这里是理查的公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And this is Richard's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get there faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  你看起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. You look..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真像我妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}like my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.78,0:08:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有穿丝袜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm wearing pantyhose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.71,0:09:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  请进  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Great! Come on in.  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  我的天  你真有钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,my God. You're rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  是我父母亲有钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,my parents are rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.43,0:09:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何  他们总会死的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,so? They gotta die someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸妈  这是菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mom,Dad,this is Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  他们是我父母 希尔多和贝西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe,these are my parents,Theodore and Bitsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希尔多  贝西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Theodore,Bitsy..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴能与你们见面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}what a delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴  终于见到你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's so nice to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼此彼此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.21,0:09:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们家真是美好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your home is lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  等一下我可以带你参观\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. I'll give you a tour later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实总共有三层\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's actually three floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的妈啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  过来客厅见见我们的朋友吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phobe, Why don't you come meet our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常荣幸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Try and stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.76,0:09:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试着让你父母亲喜欢我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Trying to get your parents to like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信他们会的  但是你不用这样假\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sure they will,but you don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要他们认识真正的菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want them to get to know Phoebe,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是装出来的"菲比"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}not "Phoebe."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:09:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} You've got it.  All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很难停止\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's hard to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  来见见我们的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe,these are our friends
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.93,0:10:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆和苏安格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tom and Sue Engel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  来坐下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe,come sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们介绍一下你自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell us a little bit about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.35,0:10:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是哪里人呢  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} So where are you from?  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  好的  我本来是上州人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,all right. Originally,I'm from upstate..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是后来我妈自杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but then my mom killed herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.86,0:10:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后继父去坐牢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and my stepdad went to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就搬到市里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I moved to the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在一辆被火烧过的车里住过一阵子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}where I lived in a burnedout Buick LeSabre for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那倒是没关系  还好啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which was okay. That was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到我染上肝炎  你知道的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Until I got hepatitis,you know..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.48,0:10:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为有个皮条客吐口水到我嘴里  然后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}because this pimp spit in my mouth and..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我已经好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I got over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后  反正\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And,anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我是自由按摩治疗师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}now I'm a freelance massage therapist..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.53,0:10:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赚的钱不是很稳定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}which isn't always steady money,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.55,0:10:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但至少不用缴税\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but at least I don't pay taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那大家都到哪度暑假呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So where does everyone summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.84,0:11:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  天啊  真是进行的不顺利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,God,this is not going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你做的很好  真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,you're doing fine. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你何不去找我爸聊聊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you go talk to my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好的  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay,okay,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你依然确定要我表现真实的自己吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Still sure about me being myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.57,0:11:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许少说一些"皮条客吐口水"的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Though maybe just a little less "pimp spit."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.65,0:11:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希尔多  我现在知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So,Theodore,I can see
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克的帅气外表是遗传自谁的了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}where Mike gets his good looks from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定经常做运动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You must work out all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是很常  不过是尽量而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not all the time. I do the best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我想也是  看招\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah,I bet. Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  我的天  你还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,my God. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最近刚动完手术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I recently had surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  没关系  我没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I'm so sorry.  No,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是  应该去检查一下伤口\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just should check the stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.03,0:11:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really really am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会知道呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How could you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你"当然不会"打我的肚子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why wouldn't you punch me in the stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚是不是打了我爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you just hit my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:11:59.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有见过男朋友的父母亲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've never met a boyfriend's parents before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  你总该见过人  对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But,I mean,you have met humans before,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你何不去找我妈聊聊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you go talk to my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.09,0:12:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  你妈  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay,yeah,your mom. Ok.
